      "side": 1,
      "message": "This also needs some pure secret entropy as input; from a FIPS perspective, the dev_salt as comes out of keyladder is not pure enough.\n\nThus some 256 bit of generated-once random and stored when u2f is activated. The FIPS haggling will be about quality of that random, which has headroom.\n\nkey_handle should be labelled as additional input parameter only.\n\nThus the 3 parameters to this drbg_init should be\n1) stored pure entropy\n2) dev_salt\n3) key_handle",
      "revId": "54c7746b7118d0bceaa9e686ec6b594a95d97a24",
